{"agency_id": "courts-nz", "canonical_url": "https://www.courtsofnz.govt.nz/cases/r-v-heremaia", "captured_at": "2026-06-12T06:23:53.289216+00:00", "content": "R v Heremaia\n\nJimmy Heremaia sentenced to life imprisonment with a minimum period of imprisonment of 12 years. <br />Held: The subsequent burning of Ms Rigby's body was an aggravating factor justifying an uplift to the minimum period of imprisonment. <br />Sentence of 12 months' home detention imposed on Ropine Paul, who was a party to arson.", "content_hash": "25a817c67a0d50f47b546b5208c727547de25f271845227986f3dab5fb9b5e27", "cross_source_ids": {"feed_entry_id": "78575a3a99f493a89a066d1e", "feed_url": "https://www.courtsofnz.govt.nz/judgments/high-court/RSS"}, "extraction_method": "feedparser", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-04-10T12:00:00+00:00", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/rss/2025-04/7edca5ff6bc5e80bb9e539be.json", "record_id": "rss:7edca5ff6bc5e80bb9e539be", "source_account": "courtsofnz.govt.nz", "source_kind": "rss_entry", "source_platform": "rss", "source_url": "https://www.courtsofnz.govt.nz/judgments/high-court/RSS"}
