{"agency_id": "courts-nz", "canonical_url": "https://www.courtsofnz.govt.nz/cases/movement-v-minister-of-transport", "captured_at": "2026-06-12T06:23:53.288600+00:00", "content": "Movement v Minister of Transport\n\nApplication for interim relief under s 15 of the Judicial Review Procedure Act 2016 declined. Held: applicant could not show it had a position that was necessary to preserve when the granting of interim relief would have involved preventing the Minister from implementing a broad public policy setting. Discretionary factors more broadly also weighed against the granting of interim relief.", "content_hash": "8966ee018e8d584ef12e95a272985fee390a58b9e0ff7cb83422e3d004b16cac", "cross_source_ids": {"feed_entry_id": "58a3d4ba1d3e35cf0100abfb", "feed_url": "https://www.courtsofnz.govt.nz/judgments/high-court/RSS"}, "extraction_method": "feedparser", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-04-13T12:00:00+00:00", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/rss/2025-04/e965c1e07e1560caec29f523.json", "record_id": "rss:e965c1e07e1560caec29f523", "source_account": "courtsofnz.govt.nz", "source_kind": "rss_entry", "source_platform": "rss", "source_url": "https://www.courtsofnz.govt.nz/judgments/high-court/RSS"}
